From 7b2adc4f75acca26f2b356fbf9a47a9644c39bc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:19:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): preserve link identity across bounded archives

Export regular hardlinks as one payload with earlier-name aliases and
roundtrip symbolic links with bounded long names and targets. Restore uses
exact entry identity and configured namespace/data budgets without a fixed
2 GiB ceiling. Preserve atomic publication and startup failure cleanup.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
